{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_030iku0633_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_030iku0633_1000_p", "source_sha256": "05c04f26d0532fedc9c366822a2b9bd6413bb415a07ec109cc4e4af62aeb070c", "ja": "（グラビア雑誌のタイアップ企画の撮影が終わった。\n育はテーマの『スライム』を楽しく演じてくれた）", "zh": "（写真杂志联动企划的拍摄结束了。\n育愉快地演绎了主题“史莱姆”）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_030iku0633_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_030iku0633_1001_p", "source_sha256": "dbdf27b4fd722484833a62e26a48062e3479e30a22fe322bf306fb463803dda5", "ja": "育、お疲れさま。今日の撮影はすごく順調だったな！", "zh": "育，辛苦了。今天的拍摄进行得非常顺利呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_030iku0633_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_030iku0633_1002_030iku", "source_sha256": "fd0fcb74cc05f48e08accc2184442271f0f7d976d80ffd226026ccc95bdd0787", "ja": "だって、今日のわたしはスライムだもん♪\nスライムはね、体がとってもやわらかいから……。", "zh": "因为今天的我可是史莱姆嘛♪\n史莱姆的身体非常柔软，所以……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_030iku0633_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_030iku0633_1003_030iku", "source_sha256": "c662f0f6ef32ee8c21a8c0aa7bf886af65be63137eb8c1235c1f20af26250ebb", "ja": "どんな生き物にも変身できちゃうんだよ！\nだから、わたしも……どんな役でもかんたんなんだよ！", "zh": "能变身成任何生物哦！\n所以，对我来说……什么角色都很简单！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_030iku0633_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_030iku0633_1004_p", "source_sha256": "cee002c60591d10d15ac9ac8fbedb56e45631bc0c81d0ecd4f5806f27e5236db", "ja": "なるほど、そういうことだったのか！\n育はずいぶん、スライムに詳しいんだなぁ。", "zh": "原来如此，是这么回事啊！\n育还真是很了解史莱姆呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_030iku0633_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_030iku0633_1005_030iku", "source_sha256": "4961a30944dbd691a4170938f092bf115634858f681eb9dd6b4894834b16272e", "ja": "うん！　劇場でね、今日のために勉強してたら、\n百合子さんが教えてくれたの。", "zh": "嗯！我在剧场为了今天学习的时候，百合子姐姐教我的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_030iku0633_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_030iku0633_1006_030iku", "source_sha256": "58c0c7cab2739254721c9e8577b2f55886dd2d0a46b80e25f6d6ed446a349172", "ja": "「スライムはファンタジーの定番モンスター！\n同じ名前でも、作品の数だけ違いがあるんだよ」って。", "zh": "“史莱姆是奇幻作品里的经典怪物！\n虽然名字一样，但不同作品里的设定其实大不相同哦”这样。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_030iku0633_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_030iku0633_1007_030iku", "source_sha256": "02ae1b635baf8043d7e7ce2ad88fbfdf8b631b7fc487ae8fbe26869f3c506956", "ja": "ほかにもいっぱい、むずかしいこと言ってたけど……\nぷるぷるでかわいいだけじゃない、ってことみたい。", "zh": "他还说了好多难懂的事情，不过……\n好像是在说，史莱姆不只是软乎乎的可爱而已。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_030iku0633_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_030iku0633_1008_p", "source_sha256": "9eacd7fdfbddc38d4c4375efc7b0c9cac763713f96186dfbefb53836cecd517f", "ja": "おお、よく勉強してるじゃないか！\n可愛い見た目でも、一応モンスターだからな。", "zh": "哦，学得很认真嘛！\n虽然看起来很可爱，但好歹也是怪物嘛。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_030iku0633_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_030iku0633_1009_030iku", "source_sha256": "6a6587005f3618a7ed970f5e1e221a3395391dac43fddc15ee535c592d6f4b79", "ja": "うん。ゲームだと、主人公と戦ったりするもんね。\n今日は、わたしがスライムだったけど……。", "zh": "嗯。在游戏里，它们可是会和主角战斗的。\n不过今天，我变成史莱姆了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_030iku0633_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_030iku0633_1010_030iku", "source_sha256": "45a7922a1661bc90024ad4204f8d0244f421ce2214fb606adb161bdb95a67409", "ja": "もしも、本物のスライムに会って……そのスライムが\nわたしに変身しちゃったらどうしよう～？", "zh": "要是遇到了真正的史莱姆……而那个史莱姆又变成了我的样子，该怎么办呀～？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_030iku0633_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_030iku0633_1011_p", "source_sha256": "f2da6827e472d552be73186d342eaf4506ef350602af0f61dcf494b77a0867c4", "ja": "ははっ。心配の必要はないんじゃないか？　育みたいに\n優しくて、アイドルにピッタリな子になると思うよ。", "zh": "哈哈。没必要担心吧？我觉得它会变成像育那样温柔、非常适合当偶像的孩子。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_030iku0633_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_030iku0633_1012_030iku", "source_sha256": "288568a3b1bc899e1ae057e7e79bcbd7d121b321b011e24cbfbf70f1dc73f1e9", "ja": "そっか！　それならスライムとわたしで、\nステージに立ったりできるかもしれないね♪", "zh": "这样啊！那样的话，说不定我就能和史莱姆一起站上舞台了呢♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_030iku0633_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_030iku0633_1013_030iku", "source_sha256": "d6addbb5b69fad559d40ed2cbe9f3ec98c91730216386de7980d508ae6c03247", "ja": "一緒に歌ったり、ダンスをしたり……わあ～！\nそれって、すっごく楽しいかも！", "zh": "一起唱歌、跳舞……哇～！\n那样的话，说不定会特别开心呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_030iku0633_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_030iku0633_1014_p", "source_sha256": "17586b53a88e33071827461810cbd2c34ad2df6a73c923e1ce8c35d8ba556fc2", "ja": "ああ。育がベースになってるから、息もピッタリだろう\nし……頼もしい仲間になりそうだな。", "zh": "啊。毕竟是以育为基础的，配合也会非常默契吧……看来会成为值得信赖的伙伴。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_030iku0633_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_030iku0633_1015_030iku", "source_sha256": "15553c9291fd110b16dab2411c15b04f6c7c423eaa7d1f1cd63f0b5f04e3e1fd", "ja": "えへへっ。新しい仲間が増えちゃった！\n桃子ちゃんや環ちゃんも仲よくしてくれたらいいな～♪", "zh": "嘿嘿，多了一个新伙伴呢！\n要是桃子和环也能和她好好相处就好了～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
